text:
Fill in each link in index.html:

GitHub: https://github.com/&lt;username&gt;
LinkedIn: your public profile URL
Kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/&lt;username&gt;
Blog: https://&lt;username&gt;.github.io/blog/ (see Chapter Chapter 7)

8.2 Add a favicon
A favicon is the small icon in the browser tab. Save a square image to images/ and add this inside the &lt;head&gt; of index.html:
&lt;link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="images/favicon.png"&gt;
